<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Contact – Kelly Trusted House</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <!-- Embedded CSS -->
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      color: #1f2937;
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #111827;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      color: #4b5563;
    }
    p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #4b5563; }
    a { color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    form {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    label {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: .3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #374151;
    }
    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      background: #fff;
      color: #1f2937;
      transition: border-color .2s ease;
    }
    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
      border-color: #2563eb;
      outline: none;
    }
    textarea { resize: vertical; }
    button {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: #2563eb;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color .3s ease;
    }
    button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }

    .contact-info {
      background: #f3f4f6;
      padding: 20px;
      border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
      margin-top: 40px;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .faqs { margin-top: 40px; }
    h2 {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      color: #111827;
    }
    h3 {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #374151;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
      form, .contact-info { padding: 16px; }
      input, textarea, select { font-size: .95rem; }
      button { width: 100%; }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    function sendViaWhatsApp(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const fm = document.getElementById('contact-form');
      const data = {
        name: fm.from_name.value.trim(),
        email: fm.from_email.value.trim(),
        company: fm.company.value.trim(),
        project_type: fm.project_type.value,
        budget: fm.budget.value,
        message: fm.message.value.trim()
      };
      let text = `New inquiry:\nName: ${data.name}\nEmail: ${data.email}\n`
               + (data.company ? `Company: ${data.company}\n` : '')
               + (data.project_type ? `Project: ${data.project_type}\n` : '')
               + (data.budget ? `Budget: ${data.budget}\n` : '')
               + `Details: ${data.message}`;
      const phone = '254759835632';
      const url = `https://wa.me/${phone}?text=${encodeURIComponent(text)}`;
      window.open(url, '_blank');
    }
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Let’s work together</h1>
    <h2 class="subtitle">Kelly’s Trusted House</h2>
    <p>Have a project in mind? Fill out the form below or reach out by email or phone. I’ll respond within 1–3 business days.</p>

    <form id="contact-form" onsubmit="sendViaWhatsApp(event)">
      <label for="full_name">Full Name</label>
      <input type="text" name="from_name" id="full_name" required />

      <label for="email">Email Address</label>
      <input type="email" name="from_email" id="email" required />

      <label for="company">Company</label>
      <input type="text" name="company" id="company" />

      <label for="project_type">Project Type</label>
      <select name="project_type" id="project_type">
        <option value="">Select project type</option>
        <option>Website Development</option>
        <option>Mobile App Development</option>
        <option>UI/UX Design</option>
        <option>Consultation</option>
        <option>Other</option>
      </select>

      <label for="budget">Project Budget</label>
      <select name="budget" id="budget">
        <option value="">Select your budget range</option>
        <option value="$10-$100">$10–$100</option>
        <option value="$100-$250">$100–$250</option>
        <option value="$250-$500">$250–$500</option>
        <option value="$500-$1000">$500–$1,000</option>
      </select>

      <label for="message">Project Details</label>
      <textarea name="message" id="message" rows="5" required></textarea>

      <button type="submit">Send Message via WhatsApp</button>
    </form>

    <section class="contact-info">
      <h2>Book a Call</h2>
      <p>If you'd prefer to talk through your project, click below to request a free consultation:</p>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:kellykoome301@gmail.com?subject=Free%20Consultation" target="_blank">
          Request a free consultation
        </a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-info">
      <h2>Direct Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:kellykoome301@gmail.com">kellykoome301@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:0759835632">0759835632</a></p>
      <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> I typically reply within 1–3 business days.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="faqs">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <h3>What types of projects do you work on?</h3>
      <p>I specialize in websites, apps, and custom software solutions using modern technologies. I collaborate with individuals and businesses to bring their ideas to life.</p>

      <h3>What is your typical project size?</h3>
      <p>I handle everything from small personal sites to larger-scale applications. I’ll tailor the scope to meet your budget and goals.</p>

      <h3>How do you structure your projects?</h3>
      <p>I usually begin with a discovery call, followed by planning, design, and development phases. Communication is frequent and transparent throughout.</p>

      <h3>Do you offer maintenance?</h3>
      <p>Yes, I offer optional ongoing support and updates to ensure your project continues to perform at its best.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
